    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15610" root="رشم" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَشَمٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَرٌ</span> [<i>A mark, an impression,</i> &amp;c.];
(Aboo-Turáb, K, TA; [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَطَرُ</span> is erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَثَرُ</span>;]) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَشْمٌ</span></b> ; (K, TA;)
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَسَمٌ</span> (Aboo-Turáb, TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَسْمٌ</span> [q. v.]. (S,
Msb, K, all in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رسم</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [particularly]
The <i>mark,</i> or <i>impression,</i> &amp;c., (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَر</span>,) <i>of rain, upon
the ground.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And The <i>first that appears
of herbage;</i> (ISk, S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْشَمٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

